#NEXUS

[ schweitzer1999a_fig7: Slanted summary cladogram, panel A, fully resolved. Aves, printed beside a node dot, is kept as an internal label. 4 tips, fully resolved; 1 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Sample 5 case (census 2, seed 20261215). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=4;
    TAXLABELS
        '“non-avian theropods”'
        Archaeopteryx
        Alvarezsauridae
        Ornithothoraces
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE schweitzer1999a_fig7 = [&R] ('“non-avian theropods”',(Archaeopteryx,(Alvarezsauridae,Ornithothoraces))Aves);
END;
